><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Dentate gyrus &#x00023;&#x00023;</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">33.0&#x000b1;4.5</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">32.4&#x000b1;4.5</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">35.4&#x000b1;3.9</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">64.5&#x000b1;6.5</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">110.1&#x000b1;13.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">127.6&#x000b1;10.8</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>F(2,24)&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;5.552, P&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;0.013</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CA1 field &#x00023;&#x00023;</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">27.4&#x000b1;2.8</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">32.3&#x000b1;3.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31.4&#x000b1;3.4</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">61.5&#x000b1;8.5</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">58.8&#x000b1;7.7</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">57.0&#x000b1;8.5</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">F(2,24)&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;0.412, P&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;0.668</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CA3 field &#x00023;&#x00023;</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18.8&#x000b1;1.9</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.4&#x000b1;2.7</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">23.9&#x000b1;3.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">59.7&#x000b1;6.9</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">63.9&#x000b1;4.2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">58.2&#x000b1;4.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">F(2,24)&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;1.498, P&#x0200a;&#x0003d;&#x0200a;0.250</td></tr><tr><td colspan="8" align="left" rowspan="1"><bold>Midbrain/pons</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PAG rostral, dorsomedial &#x00023;&#x00023;</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7.6&#x000b1;1.8</td><td align="left" rowsp